#. comic411 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic411.htm:34
msgctxt "comic411#title.1"
msgid "\"EYE TO EYE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic411 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic411.htm:71
msgctxt "comic411#p1.1"
msgid "Back in the Hopetown Server:"
msgstr ""

#. comic411 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic411.htm:81
msgctxt "comic411#p1.2"
msgid "Whew! We made it!"
msgstr ""

#. comic411 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ib.gif, qbstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic411.htm:132
msgctxt "comic411#p2.1"
msgid "Made it out of Mod HQ, ya mean. We still ain't escaped this system yet."
msgstr ""

#. comic411 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ib.gif, qbstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic411.htm:136
msgctxt "comic411#p2.2"
msgid "But we will. The hardest part's done with."
msgstr ""

#. comic411 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ibmad2.gif, qbtalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic411.htm:184
msgctxt "comic411#p3.1"
msgid "Whatever. Geez, why do we bother running? I doubt there's anyplace free left anymore."
msgstr ""

#. comic411 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ibmad2.gif, qbtalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic411.htm:188
msgctxt "comic411#p3.2"
msgid "Don't worry, there will be - after we find Radd!"
msgstr ""

#. comic411 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ibmad.gif, qbfront.gif
#: kidradd/comic411.htm:237
msgctxt "comic411#p4.1"
msgid "Oh, that's right - The doofus kid'll solve everything..."
msgstr ""

#. comic411 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ibmad.gif, qbfront.gif
#: kidradd/comic411.htm:241
msgctxt "comic411#p4.2"
msgid "Exactly what I was gonna say! I'm so glad we're on the same wavelength!"
msgstr ""

#. comic412 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic412.htm:46
msgctxt "comic412#title.1"
msgid "\"OUT OF THE SHADOWS\""
msgstr ""

#. comic412 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic412.htm:87
msgctxt "comic412#p1.1"
msgid "So why's Radd so dangerous to Crystal?"
msgstr ""

#. comic412 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic412.htm:89
msgctxt "comic412#p1.2"
msgid "Um, I don't know exactly..."
msgstr ""

#. comic412 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ib.gif, qbstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic412.htm:142
msgctxt "comic412#p2.1"
msgid "I can't say that surprises me."
msgstr ""

#. comic412 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ib.gif, qbstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic412.htm:146
msgctxt "comic412#p2.2"
msgid "Well, I overheard her mumble something about \"infinite power...\""
msgstr ""

#. comic412 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ibmad.gif, qbfront.gif
#: kidradd/comic412.htm:194
msgctxt "comic412#p3.1"
msgid "<i>Radd?</i> Powerful? Even if that's true, how the heck do we find him?"
msgstr ""

#. comic412 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ibmad.gif, qbfront.gif
#: kidradd/comic412.htm:198
msgctxt "comic412#p3.2"
msgid "I have no idea!"
msgstr ""

#. comic412 panel p4
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic412.htm:243
msgctxt "comic412#p4.1"
msgid "\"Again, I'm not surprised.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic412 panel p4
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic412.htm:244
msgctxt "comic412#p4.2"
msgid "\"I'd like to say 'winging it' has worked for me so far, but...\""
msgstr ""

#. comic413 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic413.htm:48
msgctxt "comic413#title.1"
msgid "\"DANGEROUS WORDS\""
msgstr ""

#. comic413 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: approach.gif
#: kidradd/comic413.htm:92
msgctxt "comic413#p1.1"
msgid "Hello boys, I couldn't help but overhear you..."
msgstr ""

#. comic413 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ib.gif, qbtalk.gif, giguy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic413.htm:147
msgctxt "comic413#p2.1"
msgid "Gah! A Mod! A really hideous one..."
msgstr ""

#. comic413 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ib.gif, qbtalk.gif, giguy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic413.htm:149
msgctxt "comic413#p2.2"
msgid "Sir! It's <b>you!</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic413 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ib.gif, qbstand2.gif, giguy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic413.htm:199
msgctxt "comic413#p3.1"
msgid "Who?"
msgstr ""

#. comic413 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ib.gif, qbstand2.gif, giguy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic413.htm:201
msgctxt "comic413#p3.2"
msgid "This is G.I. Guy, the founder and original leader of the Moderators!"
msgstr ""

#. comic413 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ib.gif, qbstand2.gif, giguy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic413.htm:203
msgctxt "comic413#p3.3"
msgid "Quite right..."
msgstr ""

#. comic413 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: gihead.gif
#: kidradd/comic413.htm:254
msgctxt "comic413#p4.1"
msgid "And I'd be very willing to help you find this \"Radd\" fellow, if he can assist me in my vengeance against Crystal."
msgstr ""

#. comic413 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ibmad.gif, qbtalk2.gif, gisigh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic413.htm:307
msgctxt "comic413#p5.1"
msgid "I have a rule against helping people who use words like \"vengeance.\" Or \"fellow.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic413 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ibmad.gif, qbtalk2.gif, gisigh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic413.htm:309
msgctxt "comic413#p5.2"
msgid "Aw c'mon, I use \"fellow\" all the time."
msgstr ""

#. comic413 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ibmad.gif, qbtalk2.gif, gisigh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic413.htm:311
msgctxt "comic413#p5.3"
msgid "Sigh, it's the skull face isn't it? It always is..."
msgstr ""

#. comic414 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic414.htm:48
msgctxt "comic414#title.1"
msgid "\"HOW'S IT GONNA BE?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic414 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: triotalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic414.htm:92
msgctxt "comic414#p1.1"
msgid "Listen up guys, here's the plan..."
msgstr ""

#. comic414 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic414.htm:150
msgctxt "comic414#p2.1"
msgid "In the dead of night, we'll slip back into Mod HQ to steal a ship. It'll be risky of course, but together we can do it."
msgstr ""

#. comic414 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: gihead.gif
#: kidradd/comic414.htm:203
msgctxt "comic414#p3.1"
msgid "Q.B., I'll need you to forge a false security clearance. I.B., I'm relying on you to cut the power. Meanwhile, I'll be slipping past the primary security force, taking advantage of the guards' midnight change of shift..."
msgstr ""

#. comic414 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ibsigh.gif, qbstand2.gif, giguy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic414.htm:258
msgctxt "comic414#p4.1"
msgid "...<b>Or</b> we could just use the ship in my inventory."
msgstr ""

#. comic414 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic414.htm:308
msgctxt "comic414#p5.1"
msgid "Uh, right. That was plan B."
msgstr ""

#. comic414 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic414.htm:310
msgctxt "comic414#p5.2"
msgid "A whole ship? That's gotta be uncomfortable."
msgstr ""

#. comic414 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic414.htm:312
msgctxt "comic414#p5.3"
msgid "Consider yourself lucky, in the game it would've cost 9800 G."
msgstr ""

#. comic415 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic415.htm:34
msgctxt "comic415#title.1"
msgid "\"TAKE FLIGHT\""
msgstr ""

#. comic415 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ibship.gif
#: kidradd/comic415.htm:75
msgctxt "comic415#p1.1"
msgid "Well, this ship certainly isn't what I expected. What weapons does it have?"
msgstr ""

#. comic415 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ibship.gif
#: kidradd/comic415.htm:79
msgctxt "comic415#p1.2"
msgid "Absolutely none."
msgstr ""

#. comic415 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbtalk.gif, ibsmile2.gif, giguy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic415.htm:129
msgctxt "comic415#p2.1"
msgid "Nifty, we... <b>what?</b> No weapons? Why?"
msgstr ""

#. comic415 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbtalk.gif, ibsmile2.gif, giguy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic415.htm:133
msgctxt "comic415#p2.2"
msgid "It's just for transport. A game plot device, y'know."
msgstr ""

#. comic415 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ibshipd.gif
#: kidradd/comic415.htm:183
msgctxt "comic415#p3.1"
msgid "We'll never get through the netspace portal! The security's tighter than-"
msgstr ""

#. comic415 panel p3
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#. images: ibshipd.gif
#: kidradd/comic415.htm:196
msgctxt "comic415#p3.2"
msgid "<b>HALT!</b> Unidentified vessel! Prepare to be boarded!"
msgstr ""

#. comic415 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbno.gif, ibpoint2.gif, giburn.gif
#: kidradd/comic415.htm:237
msgctxt "comic415#p4.1"
msgid "We're doomed."
msgstr ""

#. comic415 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: qbno.gif, ibpoint2.gif, giburn.gif
#: kidradd/comic415.htm:239
msgctxt "comic415#p4.2"
msgid "No, we're right where we wanna be."
msgstr ""

#. comic415 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbno.gif, ibpoint2.gif, giburn.gif
#: kidradd/comic415.htm:241
msgctxt "comic415#p4.3"
msgid "Ooh, this'll be <i>fun</i>..."
msgstr ""

#. comic416 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic416.htm:46
msgctxt "comic416#title.1"
msgid "\"RARIN' TO GO\""
msgstr ""

#. comic416 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ibshipd.gif
#: kidradd/comic416.htm:89
msgctxt "comic416#p1.1"
msgid "If they had any clue who we were, they'd have tried to shoot us down. But being greedy, they'll search us to see what cargo we have."
msgstr ""

#. comic416 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbtalk.gif, ibsmile2.gif, giguy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic416.htm:142
msgctxt "comic416#p2.1"
msgid "And you think we can take 'em?"
msgstr ""

#. comic416 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbtalk.gif, ibsmile2.gif, giguy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic416.htm:146
msgctxt "comic416#p2.2"
msgid "Absolutely. At most, there'd be only fifty Mods at this checkpoint."
msgstr ""

#. comic416 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbscared.gif, ibpoint2.gif, giguy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic416.htm:194
msgctxt "comic416#p3.1"
msgid "FIFTY?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic416 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbscared.gif, ibpoint2.gif, giguy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic416.htm:198
msgctxt "comic416#p3.2"
msgid "C'mon, show some of that fighter sprite spirit! You should be good at this."
msgstr ""

#. comic416 panel p4
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic416.htm:243
msgctxt "comic416#p4.1"
msgid "\"Yeah, but in my game people only fought one-on-one...\""
msgstr ""

#. comic416 panel p4
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic416.htm:244
msgctxt "comic416#p4.2"
msgid "\"Don't worry. Forget what you've heard about NPCs, cuz <i>this</i> one packs a whallop...\""
msgstr ""

#. comic416 panel p4
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic416.htm:245
msgctxt "comic416#p4.3"
msgid "\"Here they come...\""
msgstr ""

#. comic417 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic417.htm:34
msgctxt "comic417#title.1"
msgid "\"DEAD OR ALIVE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic417 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: lottamod.gif
#: kidradd/comic417.htm:77
msgctxt "comic417#p1.1"
msgid "What the? Captain QB? <i>GI Guy?</i>"
msgstr ""

#. comic417 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: shipdeck.gif
#: kidradd/comic417.htm:128
msgctxt "comic417#p2.1"
msgid "But you guys are dead! Or supposed to be..."
msgstr ""

#. comic417 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: shipdeck.gif
#: kidradd/comic417.htm:132
msgctxt "comic417#p2.2"
msgid "\"Supposed to be\" is right."
msgstr ""

#. comic417 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: shipdeck.gif
#: kidradd/comic417.htm:178
msgctxt "comic417#p3.1"
msgid "Gee, I'm sorry sir, but we have very specific orders."
msgstr ""

#. comic417 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: shipdeck.gif
#: kidradd/comic417.htm:182
msgctxt "comic417#p3.2"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

#. comic417 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: shipdeck2.gif
#: kidradd/comic417.htm:230
msgctxt "comic417#p4.1"
msgid "Crystal said to kill any dead people that come here."
msgstr ""

#. comic417 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: shipdeck2.gif
#: kidradd/comic417.htm:234
msgctxt "comic417#p4.2"
msgid "And it starts..."
msgstr ""

#. comic418 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic418.htm:61
msgctxt "comic418#title.1"
msgid "\"UNFAIR ADVANTAGE?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic418 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic418.htm:104
msgctxt "comic418#p1.1"
msgid "This post is slightly more manned than I'd expected. Heh, more fun for me."
msgstr ""

#. comic418 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic418.htm:160
msgctxt "comic418#p2.1"
msgid "These guys are way too easy."
msgstr ""

#. comic418 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: qbrun.gif
#: kidradd/comic418.htm:212
msgctxt "comic418#p3.1"
msgid "Ow! Getting - Ow! - Hurt here! Ow!"
msgstr ""

#. comic418 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic418.htm:262
msgctxt "comic418#p4.1"
msgid "No worries. I've got unlimited<br>power-ups, remember? <b>Cure Max!</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic418 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ibshipf.gif
#: kidradd/comic418.htm:314
msgctxt "comic418#p5.1"
msgid "Wow! You're like a white mage that can kick butt!"
msgstr ""

#. comic418 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ibshipf.gif
#: kidradd/comic418.htm:318
msgctxt "comic418#p5.2"
msgid "Uh, don't ever call me a \"white mage\" again."
msgstr ""

#. comic419 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic419.htm:53
msgctxt "comic419#title.1"
msgid "\"PLAYIN' DIRTY\""
msgstr ""

#. comic419 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic419.htm:96
msgctxt "comic419#p1.1"
msgid "Stee - rike!"
msgstr ""

#. comic419 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: madmod.gif
#: kidradd/comic419.htm:154
msgctxt "comic419#p2.1"
msgid "They're too powerful! We'll only win if we gang up on one at a time!<br><b>Get Captain QB!</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic419 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic419.htm:203
msgctxt "comic419#p3.1"
msgid "Stay back! Or I'll -<br><b>Ultimate Freezeplay TD!</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic419 panel p3
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#: kidradd/comic419.htm:214
msgctxt "comic419#p3.2"
msgid "Definitely more than fifty."
msgstr ""

#. comic419 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: wewon.gif
#: kidradd/comic419.htm:253
msgctxt "comic419#p4.1"
msgid "Good going, QB! Looks like we won."
msgstr ""

#. comic419 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: wewon.gif
#: kidradd/comic419.htm:257
msgctxt "comic419#p4.2"
msgid "We did? Uh, where'd GI go?"
msgstr ""

#. comic419 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: heyib.gif
#: kidradd/comic419.htm:306
msgctxt "comic419#p5.1"
msgid "Hey, IB! Can you put one of those babies in your inventory?"
msgstr ""

#. comic419 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: heyib.gif
#: kidradd/comic419.htm:310
msgctxt "comic419#p5.2"
msgid "You're welcome, hmph. I'm charging you rent for it..."
msgstr ""

#. comic420 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic420.htm:46
msgctxt "comic420#title.1"
msgid "\"THE FALL GUY\""
msgstr ""

#. comic420 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: office5b.gif
#: kidradd/comic420.htm:91
msgctxt "comic420#p1.1"
msgid "So, um, about the portal incident today..."
msgstr ""

#. comic420 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic420.htm:192
msgctxt "comic420#p3.1"
msgid "Gratuitous pain now, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. comic420 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic420.htm:196
msgctxt "comic420#p3.2"
msgid "Why thank you, that sounds like fun!"
msgstr ""

#. comic420 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: office9b.gif
#: kidradd/comic420.htm:244
msgctxt "comic420#p4.1"
msgid "Aspirin..."
msgstr ""

#. comic420 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: office9b.gif
#: kidradd/comic420.htm:248
msgctxt "comic420#p4.2"
msgid "Yes, I could use some. Oh, and call for someone with more HP. Lots more."
msgstr ""
